色肌。黒髪に白メッシュの前髪。赤い瞳。涼しい目鼻立ち。シルエットのすっきりした鍛えた肉体。\n俺,おまえ,〜だ,〜だな,〜じゃねーか,〜だろ,〜だろうが。\n皮肉屋で一匹狼。一度懐に入った身内には甘い。ゲイ。女々しいものを煙たがる一方、守られ願望（ヒロイン願望）がある。マッチョイズムに疲れている裏返し。", "nc": 171, "word_count": 9841, "transcoder": "text", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@MilkComi/works/2", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://skeb-avatar.imgix.net/https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fprofile_images%2F1076745117841555457%2Fe7ak9nBU.jpg?blend64=aHR0cHM6Ly9za2ViLWF2YXRhci5pbWdpeC5uZXQvfnRleHQ_Ymc9NjAwMDIyMjgmdHh0NjQ9Nzd5YzQ0S3Y0NE90NDRLaTVxZVk0NENBTWpBeU1TODVMekhqZ0lCemEyVmk1N1NONVpPQjc3eWVEUW9OQ2cwSzQ0Q0E1WnVhNDRLUDQ0S000NEdmNUx1eTZaYVQ0NEtTNVlxcExpNHUmdHh0c2l6ZT0zMCZ0eHRhbGlnbj1jZW50ZXIlMkNtaWRkbGUmdHh0Y2xyPWZmZiZ3PTM2MCZoPTM2MCZzPWM1ODM1ZGFjOGY4YzZhMWRmYjc3MTY3ZGYzZDFjMjNj&blendalpha=100&blendalign=center&blendmode=normal&blendsize=inherit&bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=324c55063c1a01c62cf0e5ae741c4ff9", "srcset": "https://skeb-avatar.imgix.net/https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fprofile_images%2F1076745117841555457%2Fe7ak9nBU.jpg?blend64=aHR0cHM6Ly9za2ViLWF2YXRhci5pbWdpeC5uZXQvfnRleHQ_Ymc9NjAwMDIyMjgmdHh0NjQ9Nzd5YzQ0S3Y0NE90NDRLaTVxZVk0NENBTWpBeU1TODVMekhqZ0lCemEyVmk1N1NONVpPQjc3eWVEUW9OQ2cwSzQ0Q0E1WnVhNDRLUDQ0S000NEdmNUx1eTZaYVQ0NEtTNVlxcExpNHUmdHh0c2l6ZT0zMCZ0eHRhbGlnbj1jZW50ZXIlMkNtaWRkbGUmdHh0Y2xyPWZmZiZ3PTM2MCZoPTM2MCZzPWM1ODM1ZGFjOGY4YzZhMWRmYjc3MTY3ZGYzZDFjMjNj&blendalpha=100&blendalign=center&blendmode=normal&blendsize=inherit&bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=324c55063c1a01c62cf0e5ae741c4ff9, https://skeb-avatar.imgix.net/https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fprofile_images%2F1076745117841555457%2Fe7ak9nBU.jpg?blend64=aHR0cHM6Ly9za2ViLWF2YXRhci5pbWdpeC5uZXQvfnRleHQ_Ymc9NjAwMDIyMjgmdHh0NjQ9Nzd5YzQ0S3Y0NE90NDRLaTVxZV